# Aura Skincare Voice Agent - Environment Variables
# The application works out of the box with zero configuration using the built-in local engine!
# If you wish to enable cloud LLM reasoning with tool calling, provide either of the following:

# Groq API Key (Recommended for ultra-fast <300ms latency)
GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_your_groq_api_key_here

# OpenAI API Key (GPT-4o mini)
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-proj-your_openai_api_key_here
